The component is driven by the current token. It writes a strong signal into the
residual stream on the word "language" (any capitalisation, or a word built on it),
and weaker signals on words about languages, speech and linguistics. Its
activation is near zero everywhere else, apart from a small negative value on
"of" right after "instance" (as in "instance of", a Wikidata-style property).

  * the word itself ("language", " Language", "languages", "-language"): about 6.5
  * the Chinese / Japanese / Vietnamese words for language (语言, 語, 语, 言): about 5
  * names of languages (English, Spanish, French, Arabic): about 1.5
  * related vocabulary (grammar, syntax, vocabulary, terminology, speak, spoken): about 1
  * look-alike words that share letters or sounds (statement, league): about 0.8
  * "of" after "instance": about -0.6
"""

